/-- Convert the explicit maximal-blocker-segment data into the chosen-block
atom barrier package.  This is the formal version of the Claim B.3 step
“if the blocker entered from below, the three connectors would form a cross”:
the previous and next boundary atoms are turned into orientation-free
lower-neighbor atom data, and the later conversion discharges those data by
