  refine gridMinor_or_degree_drop_of_full_invariant_actions ?_
    hterminal I₀ Inv₀
  intro I Inv hnot
  exact fullInvariantSimplifyingActionOutcome_of_action_certificates
    hbump hcross hbump_next_inv hcross_next_inv I Inv hnot

