/-- Boundary-aware full-invariant loop with the terminal branch stated as
ordered Claim B.2 plus the ordered finite-ascent proof package for Claim B.3.
This is the current closest formal interface to the paper's terminal
hill-elimination argument. -/
theorem gridMinor_or_degree_drop_of_extended_ordered_claimB2_pathHillNormal
    {R : IndexedAuxiliaryPrefix L h} {hpos : 0 < h}
    {Q : PerfectPathPacking G R.X R.Y}
