ordinary action certificates plus the expanded successor future-clean
invariant. -/
theorem theoremB1_gridMinor_or_rerouted_linkage_of_page60ActionFutureCleanPathHillProofData
    [Fintype V] {L : PerfectPathPacking G A B} {h : ℕ}
    (D : ∀ hpos : 0 < h,
