contact survival is supplied by branch-specific extended-row traces and the
terminal branch is supplied by the full terminal sparse-grid proof package. -/
theorem theoremB1_gridMinor_or_rerouted_linkage_of_page60PaperSparseFullProofDataTypeTwoInputByBumpAndCrossTraceData
    [Fintype V] {L : PerfectPathPacking G A B} {h : ℕ}
    (D : ∀ hpos : 0 < h,
      TheoremB1Page60PaperSparseFullProofDataTypeTwoInputByBumpAndCrossTraceData
